 players leap, climb, and swing through a mysterious shadowy environment. Set in a world cloaked in perpetual twilight, the game combines fast-paced movement mechanics with a hauntingly beautiful atmosphere, encouraging both competitive gameplay and exploration.\n\nKey Features:\nFluid Parkour Movement: Run, jump, and climb seamlessly as you navigate intricate environments full of hidden paths and secret areas.\nDynamic Shadow World: Explore a unique setting where dark forests, abandoned ruins, and glowing caves create a visually stunning yet eerie landscape.\nStrategic Gameplay: Evade enemies, chase down opponents, and outsmart your friends in a variety of game modes like tag, hide-and-seek, and capture the orb.\nCustomizable Characters: Personalize your shadow creature with unique skins, glowing patterns, and accessories that match your style.\nSocial Multiplayer Experience: Join friends or meet new players in vibrant lobbies with proximity chat and cooperative mini-games.\nProject Shadows combines the physical challenge of tag with a dark and enigmatic world where every movement counts, every shadow hides a secret, and every game tells a new story. Can you master the shadows?", "short_description": "Project Shadows is an immersive and thrilling gorilla tag-inspired multiplayer game where players leap, climb, and swing through a mysterious shadowy environment. Set in a world cloaked in perpetual twilight, the game combines fast-paced movement mechanics with a hauntingly beautiful atmosphere, encouraging both competitive gameplay and exploration.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/project-shadows/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "illidarien", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/project-shadows/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": 